Ok, today must be my lucky day...(minor Spoilers)

I had a Barbarian on level 3 of the dungon and I happened upon a wand.
I engrave and I find out that it's a wand of wishing.  Awesome.  I
wish for stormy, and go out looking for monsters.  I really didn't
know what else to wish for so I figure I'll save the charges.  Three
moves later I bump into a hobbit and he kills me in one blow!
AAaarrgh! I had 6 hp.  The hobbit must have had a better sword than I
did.

Well...oh well I think and I play a few other characters which get
killed pretty quick.  Then I decide to play an archeologists.  The 'ol
Indinana Jones.  In the second room I find a spiked wand, engrave
and bingo! another wand of wishing.  (I *told* you that it was my
lucky day).  Anyway I wish for a blessed +3 helm of telepathy (figure
it would be cool to see monsters around me).  What else should I wish
for?  I know that if I get far enough I can get a named weapon from my
god, or just convert a long sword.  I also know if I get lucky I can
polymorph for dragon scale mail, but I don't want to die between now
and then.  Suggestions welcome via e-mail would be appreciated.
Please explain the reason for wishing for a specific item.

This character *is* going to win....

